# generated TUI previews: SVG 可入库（docs/tui-tour.md 直接引用），PNG 是本地渲染产物
docs/preview/*.png

# test/CLI scratch dirs (environment fallbacks, never committed)
.pytest-tmp/
.uiu-smoke/
.pytest_cache/

